# The touch clipboard bubble and handles of the shared TextField (docs/dev/clipboard.md, step 2) with a physical keyboard
# present and so no on-screen keyboard (keyboards 1, APPLAUNCH_OSK auto): the bubble goes above the field when it fits,
# else below the handles; a tap still shows nothing the keyboard would (expect_osk hidden stays true throughout);
# a physical key puts the bubble away. Same geometry checks as clipboard_bubble. Review only.
title text field: touch bubble without an on-screen keyboard
review
sizes 800x480 640x480 480x320
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 0
env APPLAUNCH_OSK auto
keyboards 1
apps Settings CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
home
clipboard server on
clipboard set "12345"
fielddemo
wait 300
expect_osk hidden
tapchar Name 4
expect_caret Name 4
expect_handles Name caret
expect_bubble Name none
shot nokbd_caret_handle
taphandle Name caret
expect_bubble Name "Select all|Paste"
expect_osk hidden
expect_editing Name on
shot nokbd_bubble_below
tapbubble Name "Select all"
expect_selection Name 0 16
expect_handles Name range
expect_bubble Name "Cut|Copy|Paste"
shot nokbd_range
doubletapchar Name 9
expect_selection Name 8 11
expect_bubble Name "Cut|Copy|Paste|All"
expect_osk hidden
shot nokbd_word
# a physical key: the bubble and the handles go, the selection stays for the keyboard to use
key SHIFT+RIGHT
expect_handles Name none
expect_bubble Name none
expect_selection Name 8 12
# a field further down: room above the field
key DOWN
key DOWN
wait 600
tapchar Port 2
expect_handles Port caret
taphandle Port caret
expect_bubble Port "Select all|Paste"
expect_osk hidden
shot nokbd_bubble_above
tapbubble Port "Paste"
# the clipboard text is cut to the field maximum (5 digits): one digit fits
expect_field Port "80180"
expect_handles Port caret
expect_bubble Port none
